---
import '../styles/global.css';
import { siteUrl } from '../../site.config.mjs';

const releaseUrl = 'https://github.com/JDChi/WeReadBar/releases/latest/download/WeReadBar.dmg';
const repoUrl = 'https://github.com/JDChi/WeReadBar';
const issuesUrl = 'https://github.com/JDChi/WeReadBar/issues';
const tokenGuideUrl = 'https://weread.qq.com/r/weread-skills';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#ffffff" />
    <meta name="description" content="WeReadBar 是一个轻量的 macOS 菜单栏应用，用年度热力图呈现微信读书的阅读数据。" />
    <link rel="canonical" href={`${siteUrl}/`} />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/app-icon.png" />
    <title>WeReadBar · 把一年读过的日子，留在眼前</title>
    <!-- Google tag (gtag.js) -->
    <script async src="https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=G-SH5L08LS9H"></script>
    <script is:inline>
      window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];
      function gtag() { window.dataLayer.push(arguments); }
      gtag('js', new Date());
      gtag('config', 'G-SH5L08LS9H');
    </script>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header class="site-header">
      <nav class="nav" aria-label="主导航">
        <a class="brand" href="#top" aria-label="WeReadBar 首页"><img src="/app-icon.png" width="32" height="32" alt="" /><span>WeReadBar</span></a>
        <div class="nav-actions"><a class="github-link" href={repoUrl} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" aria-label="在 GitHub 查看 WeReadBar 源码" title="GitHub"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.59 2 12.25c0 4.53 2.87 8.37 6.84 9.73.5.1.68-.22.68-.49 0-.24-.01-1.04-.01-1.89-2.78.62-3.37-1.2-3.37-1.2-.45-1.19-1.11-1.5-1.11-1.5-.91-.64.07-.63.07-.63 1 .07 1.53 1.06 1.53 1.06.9 1.57 2.35 1.12 2.92.86.09-.67.35-1.12.64-1.38-2.22-.26-4.56-1.14-4.56-5.08 0-1.12.39-2.03 1.03-2.75-.1-.26-.45-1.31.1-2.73 0 0 .84-.28 2.75 1.05A9.3 9.3 0 0 1 12 6.95c.85 0 1.7.12 2.5.35 1.91-1.33 2.75-1.05 2.75-1.05.55 1.42.2 2.47.1 2.73.64.72 1.03 1.63 1.03 2.75 0 3.95-2.35 4.81-4.58 5.06.36.32.68.93.68 1.88 0 1.36-.01 2.46-.01 2.79 0 .27.18.6.69.49A10.27 10.27 0 0 0 22 12.25C22 6.59 17.52 2 12 2Z" /></svg></a><a class="nav-download" href={releaseUrl}>下载</a></div>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main id="top">
      <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
        <img class="hero-icon" src="/app-icon.png" width="96" height="96" alt="" />
        <p class="product-name">WeReadBar</p>
        <h1 id="hero-title">把一年读过的日子，<br />留在眼前。</h1>
        <p class="hero-copy">一个安静地住在 macOS 菜单栏里的微信读书阅读面板。</p>
        <div class="hero-actions"><a class="button button-primary" href={releaseUrl}>下载 macOS 版</a></div>
        <p class="requirements">需要 macOS 14 Sonoma 或更高版本</p>
      </section>

      <section class="showcase" aria-labelledby="showcase-title">
        <div class="showcase-caption"><span id="showcase-title">在菜单栏，看见这一年的阅读。</span><span>全年热力图</span></div>
        <img src="/wereadbar-popover.png" alt="WeReadBar 弹窗，展示过去一年的阅读热力图、今日阅读、连续阅读和书架统计" width="1612" height="628" />
      </section>

      <section class="story" aria-labelledby="story-title">
        <p class="eyebrow">READING, AT A GLANCE</p>
        <h2 id="story-title">一年，终于有迹可循。</h2>
        <p class="story-copy">过去 53 周、371 天的阅读时长，变成一张属于你的热力图。它不会催促你打卡，只让你看见已经发生的阅读。</p>
      </section>

      <section class="features" aria-label="核心能力">
        <article><h3>全年热力图</h3><p>每一天的阅读，都留下一点颜色。</p></article>
        <article><h3>抬头即见</h3><p>今日、连续、本周，打开菜单栏便知道。</p></article>
        <article><h3>继续阅读</h3><p>从当前在读，一键回到微信读书。</p></article>
      </section>

      <section class="closing" aria-labelledby="closing-title">
        <p class="eyebrow">MADE FOR MACOS</p>
        <h2 id="closing-title">读书时，忘记它。<br />想看时，它就在。</h2>
        <p>Token 仅保存在你的 Mac。没有遥测，没有广告，也不上传阅读记录。</p>
        <a class="button button-primary" href={releaseUrl}>下载 WeReadBar</a>
      </section>

      <section class="faq" id="faq" aria-labelledby="faq-title">
        <h2 id="faq-title">常见问题</h2>
        <div class="faq-list">
          <details><summary>为什么需要 WeRead Token？<span aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><p>WeReadBar 需要读取书架、每日阅读时长和当前在读，才能生成热力图与摘要。你可以在 <a href={tokenGuideUrl} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">微信读书 WeRead Skills 页面 ↗</a> 获取 Token。</p></details>
          <details><summary>我的 Token 和阅读数据安全吗？<span aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><p>Token 只保存在这台 Mac 的本地应用偏好设置中。WeReadBar 不上传阅读记录、不做账号体系，也不接入广告或行为追踪服务。</p></details>
          <details><summary>第一次打开被 macOS 拦截怎么办？<span aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><p>当前版本通过 GitHub Release 分发，尚未进行 Apple 开发者签名与公证。按系统提示在“隐私与安全性”中选择“仍要打开”即可。</p></details>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer><div class="footer-inner"><a class="brand" href="#top"><img src="/app-icon.png" width="28" height="28" alt="" /><span>WeReadBar</span></a><div><a href={repoUrl} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">GitHub ↗</a><a href={issuesUrl} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">反馈问题 ↗</a></div></div></footer>
  </body>
</html>
